      <p>These terms apply to orders in the Capshot online shop. The contracting party is Paul Grossfeld, sole trader, Konradstraße 8, 48145 Münster, Germany, email <a href="mailto:Grossfeld.paul@gmail.com">Grossfeld.paul@gmail.com</a>, phone <a href="tel:+491771475356">+49 177 1475356</a> (“we”).</p>
